{"parentUuid":"6d5785ef-a0b4-4082-89c6-3175a8fab870","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cdi4cVBop8qJSioxPXyWz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"r05.\n\nThe premise is incorrect — this project does **not** use GraphQL. The public API is defined using **Protocol Buffers (protobuf)** with **gRPC** and **gRPC-Gateway** (HTTP/JSON transcoding).\n\nThe API schema is defined in `.proto` files under `proto/api/v1/`:\n\n- `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto` — Memo CRUD operations\n- `proto/api/v1/user_service.proto` — User management\n- `proto/api/v1/auth_service.proto` — Authentication\n- `proto/api/v1/attachment_service.proto` — Attachments\n- `proto/api/v1/instance_service.proto` — Instance settings\n- `proto/api/v1/idp_service.proto` — Identity providers\n- `proto/api/v1/shortcut_service.proto` — Shortcuts\n- `proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto` — AI features\n- `proto/api/v1/common.proto` — Shared types\n\nEach `.proto` file defines gRPC `service` blocks with `rpc` methods, and uses `google.api.http` annotations to expose them as RESTful HTTP endpoints (e.g., `POST /api/v1/memos`, `GET /api/v1/memos`). The buf toolchain (`proto/buf.yaml`, `proto/buf.gen.yaml`) generates Go code into `proto/gen/`, and the resulting HTTP handlers are wired through the router at `server/router/api/`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":45708,"output_tokens":374,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":697,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cdi4cSXpckbYo72uS4JeQ","attributionMcpServer":"gitnexus","attributionMcpTool":"route_map","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b4aa9f2-5c23-439e-94bc-f4ece57d16ed","timestamp":"2026-08-04T16:58:24.419Z"